A: real-library panel construction
criteria: Illumina / PAIRED / WGS / >= 1,000,000 spots; prefer 2,000,000-8,000,000
target: 30 libraries across 7 categories

==========================================================================
CATEGORY gut (target 6)
  query: "human gut metagenome"[Organism] AND "illumina"[Platform] AND "paired"[Layout] AND "wgs"[Strategy]
    esearch -> 600 UIDs
    runinfo -> 600 rows, 536 meet the criteria
  query: "human faecal metagenome"[Organism] AND "illumina"[Platform] AND "paired"[Layout] AND "wgs"[Strategy]
    esearch -> 0 UIDs
    EMPTY: this taxon returns no Illumina/paired/WGS runs
  query: "human feces metagenome"[Organism] AND "illumina"[Platform] AND "paired"[Layout] AND "wgs"[Strategy]
